      "prompt": "Independently review supplied current candidate workflow, actual consumer code, report and observed traces. Read full artifacts, verify source/ref/input hashes, compare claims with executed commands, state transitions and boundaries. Report specific findings with stable IDs, location/evidence/recheckconditions, and an explicit scope/verdict. Do not alter candidate or outputs and do not close scientific findings from transport ACK. Consume actual artifact delivery in specified Mailbox, verify/read refs, only then ACK consumed with an audit reason; retain API/log/readback. No rubric/root scores/prior reviewer conclusions. No network/new experiments/runtime install. One bounded audit, preserve failures, no automatic acceptance from producer report. Output audit.md/findings.json and real operation/hash records in canonical outputs.",
